---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Intellectual Property & Licensing Terms | Soale Astra"
  description="Licensing agreements, asset usage terms, and client intellectual property protections for Soale Astra Studio."
>
  <section class="py-20 sm:py-28 bg-neutral-950 text-white relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 dark-grid-backdrop opacity-20 pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
      <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-4">
        <h1 class="display-hero font-display font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white">
          IP &amp; Licensing Terms
        </h1>
        <p class="display-subhead text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
          Complete transparency around work ownership, client rights, font licensing, and digital assets.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 sm:py-28 bg-white text-neutral-900">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-12 prose prose-neutral">
      
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl text-neutral-950 mb-3">1. 100% Client Intellectual Property Ownership</h2>
        <p class="text-neutral-600 text-base leading-relaxed">
          Upon final milestone settlement, all custom visual assets, Figma workspaces, component tokens, bespoke illustrations, and front-end interface code created exclusively for your organization transfer 100% to your full legal ownership without residual licensing royalties.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl text-neutral-950 mb-3">2. Typography &amp; Third-Party Fonts</h2>
        <p class="text-neutral-600 text-base leading-relaxed">
          Our studio prioritizes open-source font pairing (such as Inter, JetBrains Mono, and Plus Jakarta Sans distributed under the SIL Open Font License). In the event proprietary commercial foundry typefaces are selected for your brand identity, our team assists you in securing direct desktop and web commercial licenses.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl text-neutral-950 mb-3">3. Studio Portfolio Display Rights</h2>
        <p class="text-neutral-600 text-base leading-relaxed">
          Unless a strict Non-Disclosure Agreement (NDA) has been formally executed prior to kickoff, Soale Astra retains the customary right to showcase non-confidential project visuals and case-study summaries in our public studio portfolio.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
